// T28 (RFC §7.5): an invariant that holds across ALL lawful actions (`--mode lawful` passes),
// while an unlawful physical host action followed by an unguarded payout violates conservation
// (`--mode adversarial` and `--mode mixed --adversary MalHost` discover & shrink the 2-step trace).
Fact host Identified by GoodHost, MalHost.
Fact vault-locked Identified by host.
Fact paid-out Identified by host.
Fact tampered Identified by host.

Act lawful-heartbeat Actor host Holds when True.

// Unlawful physical act (`Holds when False`, default `Valid when True`):
Act unlawful-tamper Actor host
  Holds when False
  Creates tampered(host)
  Terminates vault-locked(host).

// Buggy release rule forgot `Valid when !tampered(host)`:
Act release-payout Actor host
  Holds when !vault-locked(host)
  Creates paid-out(host).

Invariant no-tampered-payout
  When (Forall host: !(tampered(host) && paid-out(host))).

+vault-locked(GoodHost).
+vault-locked(MalHost).
